: outcome 3","content":"Describe and write equations for reactions of specified Period 3 oxides with water and identify likely solution pH.","topic":"9.2","objectives":["9.2.3"],"metadata":{"source":"structured-cambridge-dataset","section":"9","outcomeIndex":3}},{"level":"as_level","kind":"learning_outcome","knowledge_key":"outcome|9.2|4","title":"Periodicity of chemical properties of the elements in Period 3: outcome 4","content":"Describe, explain and write equations for acid-base behaviour of specified Period 3 oxides and hydroxides, including relevant amphoteric behaviour.","topic":"9.2","objectives":["9.2.4"],"metadata":{"source":"structured-cambridge-dataset","section":"9","outcomeIndex":4}},{"level":"as_level","kind":"learning_outcome","knowledge_key":"outcome|9.2|5","title":"Periodicity of chemical properties of the elements in Period 3: outcome 5","content":"Describe, explain and write equations for reactions of specified Period 3 chlorides with water and identify likely solution pH.","topic":"9.2","objectives":["9.2.5"],"metadata":{"source":"structured-cambridge-dataset","section":"9","outcomeIndex":5}},{"level":"as_level","kind":"learning_outcome","knowledge_key":"outcome|9.2|6","title":"Periodicity of chemical properties of the elements in Period 3: outcome 6","content":"Explain trends in Period 3 chemical properties using bonding and electronegativity.","topic":"9.2","objectives":["9.2.6"],"metadata":{"source":"structured-cambridge-dataset","section":"9","outcomeIndex":6}},{"level":"as_level","kind":"learning_outcome","knowledge_key":"outcome|9.2|7","title":"Periodicity of chemical properties of the elements in Period 3: outcome 7","content":"Suggest bonding types in specified chlorides and oxides from chemical and physical properties.","topic":"9.2","objectives":["9.2.7"],"metadata":{"source":"structured-cambridge-dataset","section":"9","outcomeIndex":7}},{"level":"as_level","kind":"topic","knowledge_key":"topic|9.3","title":"Chemical periodicity of ot